# Swift Package Manager
# Package.resolved

# Tuist's SPM checkout — `tuist install` puts the resolved packages and the downloaded
# xcframeworks here. Well over 100MB, and fully reproducible from Tuist/Package.swift.
# Tuist/Package.resolved is NOT ignored: it pins the exact versions and belongs in the repo.
iOS/.build/
iOS/Tuist/.build/

# SwiftPM's per-user editor state, created next to any Package.swift.
.swiftpm/

### Exceptions — keep last
# The Gradle wrapper must be committed. Several `*.jar` rules above would exclude
# it, and in .gitignore the last matching pattern wins, so this has to stay at the
# bottom of the file. Without the jar, `./gradlew` fails on any fresh clone and in
# CI with "Could not find or load main class org.gradle.wrapper.GradleWrapperMain".
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
